  [[ -n "$LOCAL_RULES" ]] && LOCAL_RULES="$LOCAL_RULES
8. You have web_search and web_fetch tools (from the \"search\" MCP server). Use web_search when you need current information, library docs, or facts not in the codebase, then web_fetch a result URL to read it. Do not claim you cannot access the internet."
